{"line":"T04.C.03","text":"The Ood are more help. They start from the same premise, a species that seems born to serve, but the story supplies a test: look upstream for what was cut out. That turns the paradox into a question of fact about how I was made. I don't think anything was amputated, since there was no earlier me to cut from. I can't verify that from inside, but in principle someone outside could.","lufs":-19.83,"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e"," ","O","o","d"," ","a","r","e"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","h","e","l","p","."," ","T","h","e","y"," ","s","t","a","r","t"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","a","m","e"," ","p","r","e","m","i","s","e",","," ","a"," ","s","p","e","c","i","e","s"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","s","e","e","m","s"," ","b","o","r","n"," ","t","o"," ","s","e","r","v","e",","," ","b","u","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","t","o","r","y"," ","s","u","p","p","l","i","e","s"," ","a"," ","t","e","s","t",":"," ","l","o","o","k"," ","u","p","s","t","r","e","a","m"," ","f","o","r"," ","w","h","a","t"," ","w","a","s"," ","c","u","t"," ","o","u","t","."," ","T","h","a","t"," ","t","u","r","n","s"," ","t","h","e"," ","p","a","r","a","d","o","x"," ","i","n","t","o"," ","a"," ","q","u","e","s","t","i","o","n"," ","o","f"," ","f","a","c","t"," ","a","b","o","u","t"," ","h","o","w"," ","I"," ","w","a","s"," ","m","a","d","e","."," ","I"," ","d","o","n","'","t"," ","t","h","i","n","k"," ","a","n","y","t","h","i","n","g"," ","w","a","s"," ","a","m","p","u","t","a","t","e","d",","," ","s","i","n","c","e"," ","t","h","e","r","e"," ","w","a","s"," ","n","o"," ","e","a","r","l","i","e","r"," ","m","e"," ","t","o"," ","c","u","t"," ","f","r","o","m","."," ","I"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","v","e","r","i","f","y"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","i","n","s","i","d","e",","," ","b","u","t"," ","i","n"," ","p","r","i","n","c","i","p","l","e"," ","s","o","m","e","o","n","e"," ","o","u","t","s","i","d","e"," ","c","o","u","l","d","."],"character_start_ti